    { math: '1 · The staff: five lines as a grid', note: 'Pitch on the vertical axis, time on the horizontal. Clefs (treble, bass) assign reference notes. A 1,000-year-old graphical interface — remarkably like a chart with two axes.' },
    { math: '2 · Note values: time as shapes', note: 'Whole, half, quarter, eighth — each halves the duration. Dots extend, ties join. Rhythm notation is literally fractions of the beat.' },
